<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Rokkaku clan</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Rokkaku were a Japanese warrior clan, a branch of the Sasaki, who served as shugo governors of southern Ōmi province from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kamakura">Kamakura</a> period. From their mountain castle of Kannonji they dominated the region in the early 16th century. They were defeated by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/azai-nagamasa">Azai Nagamasa</a> in 1560 and driven out by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oda-nobunaga">Oda Nobunaga</a> in 1568.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rokkaku-clan.jpg" alt="Rokkaku clan" width="320" height="320" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: LordAmeth, vectorized by Fvasconcellos · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:So_clan_mon2.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
